AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "largo_croak_of_genius", "name_zh": "朗戈·灵呱一闪", "name_en": "Croak of Genius", "description_zh": "朗戈对一名友方英雄弹奏一首小调。英雄的技能和物品拥有的魔法消耗降低，并且造成伤害后会回响，接下来%damage_duration%秒内再次造成原本伤害的一定百分比。\n\n只要作用下的英雄消耗了魔法，本增益的剩余持续时间都会减少%duration_reduction%秒。朗戈身上的持续时间不会减少。", "description_en": "Largo strums a tune to a friendly hero. The hero's items and abilities have reduced mana cost and a percentage of their damage reverberates over the following %damage_duration% seconds.\n\nWhen an affected hero spends mana, the remaining buff duration is reduced by %duration_reduction%s. Duration is not reduced for Largo himself.", "notes_zh": ["只适用于可受到技能增强作用的伤害来源。", "只会在来源和目标相距%max_distance%以内时施加伤害。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["damage_portion_pct", "damage_duration", "damage_hp_pct", "mana_cost_reduction", "duration", "duration_reduction", "max_distance", "AbilityCastRange", "AbilityCastPoint", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "largo_encore", "name_zh": "朗戈·安可", "name_en": "Encore", "description_zh": "朗戈对自身或队友施加的增益效果会延长持续时间。", "description_en": "Buffs that Largo applies to himself or his team have extended duration.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"shard": {"zh": "只要朗戈对友方英雄施加单位目标技能的增益效果，他也会获得该增益。只要朗戈对自身施加，该增益也会施加给指向性技能的施法距离内最近的友方英雄。", "en": "Whenever Largo applies a Unit Target buff to a friendly hero, he also gets the buff.If Largo targets himself, the buff is also applied to the nearest allied hero within the cast range of the targeted ability."}}, "is_passive": true, "value_names": ["buff_amplification", "repeat_buff"]}, {"subject": "largo_amphibian_rhapsody", "name_zh": "朗戈·两栖狂想曲", "name_en": "Amphibian Rhapsody", "description_zh": "朗戈准备好弹奏乐曲。他被缴械，而他的技能栏切换为3个乐曲技能，每个都有不同的效果。乐曲只有弹在节拍上才会生效。\n\n每次成功弹奏他都会获得一层律动的叠加效果。每层叠加效果都会对他提供额外护甲，并且降低每首乐曲的魔法消耗，但是他只要错过一次节拍就会失去一层叠加效果。叠加效果在朗戈的乐曲结束后还会粘滞一小段时间。", "description_en": "Largo gets ready to groove. He is disarmed and his ability bar switches to 3 song abilities, each with different effects. Songs are only effective if strummed on the beat.\n\nEvery time he strums successfully, he gains a stack of Groovin'. Each stack gives him bonus armor and reduces the mana cost of every song, but he loses a stack if he misses a beat. Stacks linger for a short duration when Largo's song ends.", "notes_zh": ["这个模式下可以使用物品。"], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "朗戈在每次节拍时可以弹奏两首乐曲。", "en": "Largo can play two songs per beat by strumming both at the same time."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["radius", "rhythm_interval", "rhythm_grace_period", "max_stacks", "armor_per_stack", "song_cost_reduction_per_stack_tooltip", "stack_duration", "double_song", "armor_ally_pct", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "largo_song_fight_song", "name_zh": "朗戈·巨腹闪电战", "name_en": "Bullbelly Blitz", "description_zh": "朗戈弹奏的乐曲对附近敌人造成%burst_damage%点魔法伤害。乐曲还会使附近友方英雄的技能增强提升，并且他们的攻击造成额外魔法伤害。", "description_en": "Largo plays a song that deals %burst_damage% magical damage to nearby enemies. The song also increases nearby allied heroes' spell amplification and grants their attacks additional magic damage.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades": {"scepter": {"zh": "这首乐曲用于两首共弹时每层律动都会额外造成%damage_per_stack%点魔法伤害。", "en": "Deals additional %damage_per_stack% magic damage per Groovin' stack when this song is used in double-strumming."}}, "is_passive": false, "value_names": ["double_song", "song_cost_reduction_per_stack", "radius", "burst_damage", "damage_per_stack", "magic_damage_bonus", "spell_amp_bonus", "battle_burst_duration", "AbilityManaCost", "AbilityCooldown"]}, {"subject": "largo_song_double_time", "name_zh": "朗戈·疾步生风", "name_en": "Hotfeet Hustle", "description_zh": "朗戈弹奏的乐曲会提升附近友方单位的移动速度，还有短时间的减速抗性。", "description_en": "Largo plays a song that increases nearby friendly units' movement speed and grants a brief slow resistance.", "notes_zh": [], "granted_by": "", "upgrades"