ou cannot die from the change.", "The strength change occurs over 0.6 seconds.", "Activating or deactivating Unholy Strength does not interrupt channeling."], "attributes": ["+ 15 Damage", "+ 25 Attack Speed", "+ 6 Armor", "+ 5 Health Regeneration"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "assault", "name_zh": "强袭胸甲", "name_en": "Assault Cuirass", "description_en": "Passive: Assault Aura  Grants %aura_attack_speed% attack speed and %aura_positive_armor% armor to nearby allied units and structures, and decreases nearby enemy unit and structure armor by %aura_negative_armor%.  Radius: %aura_radius%", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 30 Attack Speed", "+ 10 Armor"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "basher", "name_zh": "碎颅锤", "name_en": "Skull Basher", "description_en": "Passive: Bash  Grants melee heroes a %bash_chance_melee%%% chance on hit to stun the target for %bash_duration% seconds and deal %bonus_chance_damage% bonus physical damage.  Bash chance for ranged heroes is %bash_chance_ranged%%%.", "notes_en": ["Does not stack with other sources of Bash.", "The following heroes cannot trigger Bash on this item: Spirit Breaker, Faceless Void, Slardar, and Kez while in Sai mode.", "Does not grant Bash to Clones and Tempest Doubles."], "attributes": ["+ 30 Damage", "+ 10 Strength"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "belt_of_strength", "name_zh": "力量腰带", "name_en": "Belt of Strength", "description_en": "", "notes_en": [], "attributes": ["+ 6 Strength"], "is_item": true}, {"subject": "bfury", "name_zh": "狂战斧", "name_en": "Battle Fury", "description_en": "Active: Chop Tree  Destroy a target tree.    Passive: Quell  Increases attack damage against non-hero units by %quelling_bonus% for melee heroes, and %quelling_bonus_ranged% for ranged.    Passive: Cleave  Deals %cleave_damage_percent%%% of attack damage as physical damage in a cone up to %cleave_distance% around the target. Deals %cleave_damage_percent_creep%%% against creeps. (Melee Only)", "notes_en": ["Cleave damage goes through sp